# =========================================================================
# 电商订单与履约集成测试套件 (order_test_suite.http)
# =========================================================================
# 运行方式：
# 1. 终端 A 启动 Mock 服务:
#    rupost mock examples/scenario_order_fulfillment/order_spec.md --port 9000
# 2. 终端 B 运行测试套件:
#    rupost test examples/scenario_order_fulfillment/order_test_suite.http \
#      --var base_url=http://127.0.0.1:9000 \
#      --var auth_token=dev_order_admin_token_2026
# =========================================================================

### 1. 正常下单流程：标准金额与商品创建 (验证 201 Created)
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item_count": 2,
  "amount": 29900,
  "currency": "CNY"
}

@assert status == 201
@assert body.id exists
@assert body.amount == 29900
@assert body.duplicated == false


### 2. 幂等防重测试：携带相同 Idempotency-Key 重复提交 (触发 Header 条件分支)
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Idempotency-Key: repeat_tx_001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item_count": 2,
  "amount": 29900,
  "currency": "CNY"
}

@assert status == 200
@assert body.duplicated == true
@assert body.id == "ord_existing_8888"


### 3. VIP 专属渠道打折：Query 参数注入 (触发 Query 条件分支)
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/orders?channel=vip
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item_count": 2,
  "amount": 26910,
  "currency": "CNY"
}

@assert status == 201
@assert body.channel == "vip"
@assert body.discount_applied == true


### 4. 鉴权防御测试：不带 Authorization 凭据发起请求 (触发未鉴权 401 分支)
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item_count": 1,
  "amount": 10000
}

@assert status == 401
@assert body.error == "Unauthorized"


### 5. 详情查询测试：查询存在的订单履约详情 (验证 200 OK)
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/detail?id=ord_std_10001
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

@assert status == 200
@assert body.id == "ord_std_10001"
@assert body.status == "paid"
@assert body.tracking_number exists


### 6. 边界异常测试：查询不存在的订单 (验证 404 Not Found)
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/detail?id=ord_non_exist
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

@assert status == 404
@assert body.error == "NotFound"


### 7. 第三方支付网关沙箱调用 (验证 Host 逃逸机制与外网解耦)
# 运行时判定：域名 httpbin.org 不属于本地契约 Host，自动逃逸绕过本地路由拦截
# @skip 若离线无外网连接可跳过
POST https://httpbin.org/post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": "ord_std_10001",
  "channel": "wechat_pay_sandbox",
  "nonce_str": "random_nonce_9988"
}

@assert status == 200
